Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 18:59:23 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] Kanban: extension points and data-part styling hooks
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Extension points kanban.board-head, kanban.column-meta and kanban.card,
resolved per doctype through src/extensions.js; without a registered
extension the board renders exactly as before. Stable data-part attributes
(board, columns, column, column-head, column-title, cards, card, ...) give
themes something to target other than utility classes.

Modified by Másquetú, 2026-10-13.
---
